window.products.push({"id":783014,"name":"chillify Table Coaster Set of 6 | Felt Coasters | Non-Slip, Heat-Resistant, Washable Table Mats | Suitable for Outdoor Use | Gray, Oval","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xAZyMUiyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stylish and modern table coasters - 6 oval placemats measuring 38.4 x 3.5 x 0.5 cm, suitable for any table. Thanks to the high-quality workmanship, the coaster set is also perfect as a gift idea for all occasions. MATERIAL - Sustainable and environmentally friendly table mats made of 100% felt for indoor and outdoor use. Robust processing and therefore durable and long-lasting. The product packaging is also made of sustainable cardboard. MULTIFUNCTIONAL - The high-quality table placemat set is ideal for hot and cold drinks & food, cups, mugs, alcoholic beverages, oil bottles, vases, flower pots, plates, bowls, and much more. Whether on a table or at a bar, in the kitchen, living room, dining room, or in the garden, annoying coffee or water stains are a thing of the past with Chillify felt coasters. CLEANING - With table and place mats, water and food stains are a thing of the past - easy and quick stain removal by wiping or rinsing - the coasters are even suitable for washing machines at 30 degrees. SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - We are a brand from Germany and consciously rely on strict quality controls. You can test all Chillify fleece drink coasters for 30 days with full return and cancellation rights. We are always available to answer any questions, even by phone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xAZyMUiyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"chillify","source_asin":"B099KJ6YHY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-783014","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099KJ6YHY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099KJ6YHY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
