window.products.push({"id":783105,"name":"Vessgra Insulated Lunch Bags for Women/Men, Floral Lunch Box, Insulated Lunch Box for Office Work School Picnic Travel Leakproof Cooler Lunch Bag with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EX5NyyJTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM MATERIALS: The flower lunch bag exterior is constructed of high density water-resistant dirt-proof 600D Oxford fabric for durability and easy cleaning. The interior lining is made of PEVA foil and thicken with 8mm EPE foam for excellent thermal resistance. Vessgra insulated lunch box with triple insulated designed five layers to keep food cold warm or fresh for hours, perfect for on-the-go meals, picnics, and road trips. LARGE CAPACITY: Vessgra lunch bag size 11\"x 6”x 10.5”(L x W x H) weight 0.75lb, equipped with front pocket and back zipper pocket and 3 mesh pockets. Lunch bags for women is enough to carry your meals, drinks, yogurt, sandwiches, fruits, or other small things you need every day. The women lunch box for work has a lot of room to pack lunch, plus some snacks for the entire day, to support you to go to work, school, beach, etc. LEAKPROOF & WATERPROOF: Insulated lunch bag extra thick premium PEVA liner and the heat-welded seams to prevent leaks and easy to clean. If sauce spills inside, just wipe it off with a wet cloth or napkin. Lunch bags floral the exterior is premium composite waterproof fabric is resistant to dirt and abrasion, vessgra premium lunch bag protecting your lunch and items inside from sporadic splatters or light rain. CONVENIENT & PORTABLE: Vessgra reusable lunch box features one reinforced handle on top and comes with a removable and adjustable shoulder which can be adjustable from 15\"to 27” when carrying options. Padded soft strap ensures comfortable carry. The wide opening design and wide bottom lunch bag makes it convenient to fill up and take food. Modern and lightweight designs (only 12 oz) are convenient to use as your lunch bag, cooler bag, picnic bag, sundry bag or shopping bag. FOR MULTIPLE OCCASIONS: We spent a lot of time crafting this lunch bag for adult in different colors for adults, teens or school kids. At the same time, flower lunch bags a variety of colors are available for men, women, boys and girls. Make it easy for work, school or going out, such as traveling or camping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EX5NyyJTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vessgra","source_asin":"B0B3XCBJSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-783105","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3XCBJSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3XCBJSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
