window.products.push({"id":783325,"name":"NITIME 36pcs Votive Candle Holders for Wedding Centerpieces, Clear Glass Candle Holder in Bulk, Tealight Candle Holder for Party Decorations and Home ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813nioQLFLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💎VOTIVE CANDLE HOLDERS - Wedding decorations: NITIME tea light holders are well-made, and the classic design of diamond-textured glass will never go out of style. The light refracted from the candle cups after lighting the candles can make any space sparkle, especially at weddings, bringing a warm and romantic atmosphere to you and your lover , is the perfect wedding table centerpiece. 💎GLASS CANDLE HOLDERS - Versatile decor: NITIME 36pcs is suitable for various large -scale festivals (Christmas, Thanksgiving，Diwali,), birthday party and dinner, especially the wedding, and also applicable to your home decoration（dinner table, bathroom and bedroom）Our candle holders are reusable year-round and make a perfect table centerpiece. 💎TEALIGHT CANDLE HOLGER- About size: Each glass candle holder is about 2.1\"D * 2.6\"H. The capacity of the candle holders is 3 oz, which works well for handmade candles. Matching regular votive candles, flameless LED light or tealight candles less than 1.8\" in diameter are also good choices. 💎CLEAR VOTIVE CANDLE HOLDERS - Focus on quality: NITIME candle holders are made of lead-free and mercury-free safe glass. At the same time, the glass wall of votive candle holder is thick enough to prevent the candle cup from bursting due to excessive temperature after lighting the candle. 💎WEDDING CENTERPIECES FOR TABLES - Reduce damage: Our candle holders are packaged in a single bubble packaging and placed separately . Then put it into a thick carton, which can reduce damage caused by the transportation to a certain extent. Nitime Tealight holder adds more security to your use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813nioQLFLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NITIME","source_asin":"B0C58TF98Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-783325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C58TF98Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C58TF98Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
