window.products.push({"id":783519,"name":"Bush Furniture Kathy Ireland Home Volcano Dusk Bookcase with Doors, Coastal Cherry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pZkhkdbTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Turn your workspace into an exquisite island retreat with the kathy ireland Home by Bush Furniture Volcano Dusk Collection. This spacious Bookcase with Doors offers beautiful hand-painted details, louvered accents, decorative bun feet and attractive Coastal Cherry finish with elegant Antique Bronze hardware. A safety strap anchors the unit to the wall for added stability, while family-friendly rounded corners and edges make the 5 Shelf Bookcase a smart home office solution. Combine beauty and functionality with open shelves for displaying knickknacks, photos or your personal library and a closed storage space to conceal projects or reference materials at the end of the day. The Bookcase has three adjustable shelves, including one concealed by the louvered doors, and two fixed for stability. With casual elegance and free-spirited contemporary style, Volcano Dusk makes a fashion statement in your home office inspired by the exotic allure of Hawaii. Build a beautiful, functional and comfortable work environment while celebrating island living with a relaxed, tropical-infused look. See the full kathy ireland Home by Bush Furniture Volcano Dusk Collection for coordinating items available to expand your space with desks, storage and more. This durable construction comes with a 3 Year Manufacturer's Warranty and features Bush Furniture's Quick-to-Assemble(TM) technology to make assembly a breeze.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pZkhkdbTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Furniture","source_asin":"B06XQ1MK91","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-783519","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XQ1MK91","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XQ1MK91","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
