window.products.push({"id":783530,"name":"Teabloom Universal Glass Tea Infuser with Multi-Functional Lid - Highly Hygienic, Non-Porous Glass Filter for Loose Tea Leaves - Odor and Stain Free","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61elPoC-bqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIVERSAL LOOSE TEA GLASS INFUSER. Large enough to prepare a full pot of tea, it easily fits most standard teapots, teacups, mugs, and travel mugs. HEATPROOF GLASS - HEALTHIER THAN METALS. Crafted of lead-safe, BPA-free, cadmium-free borosilicate glass – one of the most durable and sought-after materials containing zero chemicals. Will never absorb flavors or odors, optimizing the flavors of your favorite teas. Microwave, stovetop, and dishwasher safe. EXTRA-FINE SLITS CAPTURE THE SMALLEST TEA LEAVES. With its laser-cut slits, this infuser precision-brews every variety of tea from large to very small leaves, while the large capacity allows leaves to expand completely for full, delicious flavor. May also be used with tea bags. MULTIFUNCTIONAL LID DOUBLES AS A DRIP TRAY. Glass lid helps keep your tea hot during brewing. When you’re finished, simply set the infuser on the lid to catch drips. SATISFACTION GUARANTEED. Teabloom is the supplier of choice for five-star hotels worldwide, and manufacturer of the world’s largest selection of glass teapots. Founded on years of experience in the tea business, we are dedicated to customer service and stand behind our products with a full one-year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61elPoC-bqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Teabloom","source_asin":"B07VJJZH1N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-783530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VJJZH1N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VJJZH1N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":783531,"name":"Half Dozen Egg Cartons- Henlay Blank Flat Top Six Pack (20)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cMcOd+7KL._AC_SL1079_.jpg","description":"Cartons as fresh as your eggs! Finally, affordable 6-pack egg cartons, that stay securely closed, and won’t easily tear when you open them. If you are the owner of a small flock or have customers who prefer to buy small quantities, these cartons are for you. The cute design also makes an excellent package for gifting farm fresh eggs! Henlay cartons are sturdy and strong, made from recycled cardboard, which is stronger the paper pulp. They feature a double clasp in the front to safely secure the heaviest eggs. The interior pillars add stability and protect the carton from crushing. The flat top measures 5” x 3.25” and is perfect for adding a custom stamp or decal. Biodegradable, reusable, recyclable, and compostable, these Henlay cartons are environmentally responsible. The half-dozen quantity is perfect for storing baked goods or candy. The biodegradable cardboard is excellent for planting seedlings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cMcOd+7KL._AC_SL1079_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Henlay","source_asin":"B08QVDGRDY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-783531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QVDGRDY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QVDGRDY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
