window.products.push({"id":783542,"name":"Molblly 4 inch Tri Folding Twin Memory Foam Mattress, Folding Bed Mattress Topper Pad Camping Mattress Play Mattress Portable Guest Bed for Stayover-3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MKvnZQwRS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Molblly 4 inch Tri-fold Mattress Topper is constructed of 1'' gel memory foam+3'' high density support foam, Twin size: 38\"*75\"*4\". it is not only soft but also supportive for excellent sleep experience. Simple appearance can well match with your home décor, which is best for living room, dorm rooms and children's playrooms. Memory foam foldable mattress design combined expertise and the best materials with advanced sleep technology. Memory foam conducive to continuous airflow & breathable; skin-friendly fabrics adapt to the environment to keep the mattress surface at the ideal sleeping temperature; no-sink Foam adapt and conform to your body for optimal pressure relief, improve comfort. This folding mattress is a perfect alternative to air mattresses and is very versatile, It folds and unfolds easily and is ideal for travelling, camping, sleeping mat, floor mattress, yoga, Pilates or exercise mat, futon mattress, or for a children's play area. This 4'' mattress topper is smart package with advanced compressed package technology, delivers the mattress in a box directly to your front door. it can be folded into a compact size when not in use for space-saving, it is convenient for you to move this mattress to anywhere. This memory foam mattress fits perfectly on an RV for traveling. Molblly three-fold mattress comes with 10-year limited warranty and 30-days money-back return policy. Before first use, please allow the bare foam to rebound properly on a flat surface for 24 hours while airing out in a ventilated area. If for any reason you are not absolutely happy with your Mattress, CONTACT US and we will take care of you. We love to help!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MKvnZQwRS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Molblly","source_asin":"B08SR36HTG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-783542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SR36HTG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SR36HTG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":783543,"name":"TreeCube King Size Weighted Blanket 15 pounds(78”×85”),Cooling Weighted Blanket for Adult with Premium Glass Beads,Ultra Cozy Heavy Blanket(Grey)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711RmVgaqIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍Why you need TreeCube -- TreeCube weighted blanket king size is designed for people who have sleeping problems. It can help you calm your body and fall asleep quickly.Offers you a good way for a restful night of sleep. 👍 How to Choose -- 10% weight of your total body weight is recommended.TreeCube adult weighted blanket king size（78\"×85\",15 pounds ）suits the people who weighs 120lbs---170lbs.Our weighted blanket 15 pounds would be smaller than other ordinary blanket in order to concentrate the weight on your body.And due to its weight,you no need to choose a bigger size weighted blanket.Because it is cover your body not your bed. 👍Premium Material -- This TreeCube heavy blanket is made of premium material that offers a gentle hug for you. The material of our weighted blanket is soft,comfy and breathable.Our adult weighted blanket filled in pure glass beads, they can control the temperature and are safe for you.With TreeCube weighted blanket,you will sleep like a baby. 👍Excellent sewing technique--Using quilting technology,which is a practical technique to closely sew the outer fabric with the inner core,to ensure that the glass beads in the compartments are evenly distributed and do not leak. 👍Care Instructions -- We recommend spot clean and air dry. Frequent wash would damage the structure of the king size weighted blanket, so we suggest using another weighted blanket king size cotton duvet cover for the aim of easy cleaning and extending working life.A wonderful sleeping gift for your lover and loved ones.If you have any problem, please contact us freely, we will make it right to you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711RmVgaqIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TreeCube","source_asin":"B08XBZ7SJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-783543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XBZ7SJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XBZ7SJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
