window.products.push({"id":783617,"name":"Argstar Breathable Premium Weighted Blanket & Removable Washable Milky Cover for Adults 20 Lbs On Queen Bed, Hot and Cool Two Pieces for All Seasons w","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716RuF3XrCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2 IN 1 SET - Advanced Cool Touch Weighted Blanket And Ultra-Soft Minky Cover: Argstar weighted blanket features luxurious breathable premium fabric with a cool and smooth touch to keep a comfortable sleep for you. The removable Minky duvet cover is soft-to-the-touch, super-comfortable, and adds warmth during the winter. In hot summer, just remove it, simply unzip the zipper and untie it. TOWARD COZY SLEEP: The evenly distributed heavy blanket gives perfect pressure on your body and a unique hugging and cuddling sensation, and thus helps ease your body for a restful night of sleep. A thoughtful gift idea for men and women, Valentine's - Mother's - Father's Day, and Christmas. 7 LAYER BEADS-LOCKING DESIGN: The inside non-glue polyester padding and two extra polyester layer prevent bead shuffles and noises, which further surfaced with breathable smooth silky satin so that you can sleep in extreme quietness and coolness. The high-density sewing method enables the glass beads to lock securely and evenly in each smaller(5.9”x5.9”) compartment minimizing leakage. IDEAL CHOICE OF SIZE: It is suggested to choose a heavy blanket of about 10 % of your body weight, then add 1 lb. Please refer to our size chart for precise selection. Start with a lighter weight. Only the king-size(80”x87”) is for sharing. WASHING TIPS: For your weighted blanket, please machine wash in cold water. Tumble dry on low heat. Do not dry clean. Do not bleach. Do not iron. We suggest using spot cleaning or commercial machine washing for your weighted blanket. The Minky cover is machine washable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716RuF3XrCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Argstar","source_asin":"B091Y5R7SC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-783617","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091Y5R7SC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091Y5R7SC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
