window.products.push({"id":783704,"name":"WOOKRAYS Air Fryer, 16QT Air Fryer Toaster Oven, 10 in 1 Oilless cooker, Countertop Convection Oven, Rotisserie, Dehydrator w/Digital LED Display, Rol","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OBuIXJ9DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍗【16 Quarts Large Family Size】- Our air fryer oven features 16QT large interior capacity, 3 layers, which can serve up to whole family. You can cook a whole chicken, or big meals with the rotisserie fork and tray, incredibly easy to fry up your main course and side dish all at once. Wide temperature range(104-428 °F) enables versatile cooking functions, including air frying, rotissering, and dehydrating options in one product. 🍔【Less Oil & 360°Air Circulation】- Adopts the new technology of cooking food by 360°hot air circulation to reduces 85% less oil and fat than traditional fryers. With NTC High-Sensitivity Temperature Probe, provides more precise temperature control, which make the food crisp and without drying out. Combining built-in heating elements and thermal circulation fans, designed to heat faster, evenly, and cut your cooking time. 🍟【Intuitive LED Digital Touch Screen】- This air fryer oven's simple icons and touch panel make air frying simple. The touch panel contain 10 PRESET MENUS, just tap a preset to automatically set a temperature and time. Setting the 0-59 minutes integrated timer to your desired cooking time. A light control lets you see the progress of the food inside through the 10.6\" large visible glass window. 🍩【Lock Function & Auto Shut-off】 Equipped with lock function, press the lock button for 3 seconds, the panel will be locked and it can’t be opened until pressing button again for seconds, which prevent children from accidentally. Open the door when the oilless cooker is working, or once the preset time ends, the fryer will automatically shut off prevents overcooking and overheating. 🍳【Easy to Clean & Customer Service】- Our air fryer oven includes cooking accessories for free: oil tray, wire rack, chicken fork, fry net basket, and baking tray. All accessories are removable for easy cleaning, nonstick, dishwasher safe. In addition, we provide you 24-hour after-sale service, please feel free to contact us when necessary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OBuIXJ9DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WOOKRAYS","source_asin":"B096TGX4HX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-783704","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096TGX4HX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096TGX4HX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
