window.products.push({"id":783861,"name":"[4+4] 4 Pcs Round Ice Cube Mold, Decyam Ice Ball Maker, Silicone Ice Cube Tray, 2.5 Inch Large Sphere Ice Cube Mold with Lid and Funnels, Cocktail Whi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lerka5OOL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"[SAFE, HEALTHY] This upgraded reusable silicone ice cube tray is made of food grade and BAP free silicone, high quality AS material. They can be used in -80℃ to 180℃. Odorless and Safe. Enjoy large iceball and cute little ice bears, take care of your drinking feeling. [EASY RELEASE] Portable ice maker comes with a silicone lid. Fill in water by build-in funnel or just pour into the ice molds. After freezing for 6 hours, you can easily take out perfect sphere ice by waiting for a minute and squeezing silicone bottom. The soft silicone helps the big ice ball and ice bear to be perfectly formed. It is simple to operate and clean. [LONG LASTING] 4 pack Whiskey ice molds create 4 large 2.5 inch large and round ice balls at one time. 4 pcs bear ice molds can make 4 cute ice teddy. They melt slowly and cool your drinks for a long time, retaining temperature, allowing you to enjoy  more flavorful drinking time to the fullest and awaken vitality. [MULTI-SCENE USE] You can freeze any liquid in the balls and the little bear molds - a plethora of options. Sphere ice can be applied to frozen water, whiskey, cocktails, iced latte, juice, lemonade, ice tea and other drinks to maximize the taste of drinks, making them smoother and more delicate. Enjoy ice at bars, beach parties, restaurants and seaside vacations. Whatever you freeze will dissolve slowly in drinks. [QUALITY ASSURANCE, EXCELLENT AFTER-SALE SERVICE ]Package include - 4pcs candy color ice ball molds （Pink, Yellow, Sky Blue, Purple）, 4pcs ice bear makers, 4 pcs transparent funnels. We sincerely hope that you can enjoy a world of ice perfect making! If you encounter any other problems, please feel free to contact us, we will provide you with a quick reply and the best service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lerka5OOL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decyam","source_asin":"B0B5LBCC58","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-783861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5LBCC58","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5LBCC58","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
